{"articleNo":"74935","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=74935&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"■ 예비군대원 신고 안내(2012년도 미신고자 포함)","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2013.01.31","hit":"6234","attachments":[{"name":"예비군 대원신고_견본.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=74935&attachNo=72056"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16pt\">■ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">예비군대원 신고 안내</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\" lang=\"EN-US\">2012년도 미신고자 포함</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">예비군연대에서는 신입, 편입, 재입학생 및 휴/복학생중 군 제대 예비군에 대하여 아래와 같이 예비군대원신고를 받고 있사오니 해당되는 학생은 기간 내에 반드시 예비군연대에 오셔서 신고하시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">◆ </span><span style=\"COLOR: #ff00ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">전입신고</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\" lang=\"EN-US\">가. 신고대상 : 신입, 편입, 재입학생, 복학생중 군제대 예비군</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\" lang=\"EN-US\">나. </span><span style=\"COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">신고제외 대상</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\" lang=\"EN-US\"> : </span><span style=\"COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">기업체의 직장예비군으로 편성된 자 및 계약학과 학생(삼성 모바일공학과, 삼성경영학과, LG산업시스템공학과, 중소기업협의회 컨설팅학과),</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\" lang=\"EN-US\">학점은행제 등록학생(시간제 등록)</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\" lang=\"EN-US\">다. 신고기간 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"쪽 번호\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양신명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">1) 복학생 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조\">인터넷 신고</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; COLOR: #ff00ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양신명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양신명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양신명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">2월 1일～ 11일</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양신명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">(개인정보 정확하게 입력할 것)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"쪽 번호\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양신명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">2) 복학생 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조\">인터넷 미신고자(대학원생 포함)</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; COLOR: #ff00ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양신명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양신명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양신명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">2월 12일～28일까지<font color=\"#0000ff\"> <span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조\">예비군연대 방문신고</span></font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"쪽 번호\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양신명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">3) 재입학생 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양신명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">2월 1일～ 11일까지 <font color=\"#0000ff\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조\">예비군연대 방문신고</span></font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"쪽 번호\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양신명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">4) </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조\">신/편입생(대학원생 포함<span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양신명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span>은 2월 27일～3월 14일까지 <span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조\">예비군연대 방문신고</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"쪽 번호\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\" lang=\"EN-US\">※ 인터넷 미신고자 및 추가등록자는 등록시에 예비군연대에 방문신고</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\" lang=\"EN-US\">※ </span><span style=\"COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\" lang=\"EN-US\">2012년도 미신고자는</span><span style=\"COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">반드시 기간내에 <font color=\"#0900ff\">예비군연대&nbsp;</font></span><span style=\"COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><font color=\"#0900ff\">방문 신고</font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\" lang=\"EN-US\">라. 제출서류(</span><span style=\"COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">인터넷 미신고자</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\" lang=\"EN-US\">) : 예비군대원신고서 </span><span style=\"COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\" lang=\"EN-US\">Download 받아 작성 제출</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\" lang=\"EN-US\">(단, 병역사항을 잘 모르는 예비군은 주민등록초본 제출 : 병역사항 기재된 것) </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\" lang=\"EN-US\">마. 제출처 :</span><span style=\"COLOR: #353535; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">학교예비군연대행정실(디지탈관 122호)</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\" lang=\"EN-US\">※참고사항 : 대학직장예비군에 편성된 학생은 학업에 지장이 없도록 예비군으로서 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\" lang=\"EN-US\">의무를 최소화한 직업보호대상자로서 8시간만 훈련을 받도록 혜택이 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\" lang=\"EN-US\">부여됩니다(기간내 신고를 하지 않은 학생은 제외)</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\" lang=\"EN-US\">◆ </span><span style=\"COLOR: #ff00ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">전출신고</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\" lang=\"EN-US\">가. 대상 : 휴학 및 퇴학생(학교예비군에 편성된 학생)</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\" lang=\"EN-US\">나. 신고기간 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"쪽 번호\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양신명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">1) </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조\">인터넷 신고</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; COLOR: #ff00ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양신명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"> : 2월 1일～11일(</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양신명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"><font color=\"#ff00dd\">개인정보 정확하게 입력할 것)</font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"쪽 번호\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양신명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">2) </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조\">인터넷 미신고자</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; COLOR: #ff00ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양신명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"> : 2월 12일부터(휴/퇴학원 제출)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"쪽 번호\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조\">다. 제출처 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조\">예비군연대 행정실(디지탈관 122호)</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\" lang=\"EN-US\">※문의전화 : (054)478～7159, 7158, 7157</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\" lang=\"EN-US\">2013. 1. 31.</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 20pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">예 비 군 연 대 장</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
